1432
01:05:07,460 --> 01:05:08,180
Oh, wait.

1433
01:05:08,440 --> 01:05:09,560
Oh, they need to be raw, I think.

1434
01:05:10,100 --> 01:05:10,840
God damn it.

1435
01:05:13,540 --> 01:05:15,280
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.

1436
01:05:17,700 --> 01:05:19,080
Let's just call myself seer.

1437
01:05:20,460 --> 01:05:21,000
What was that?

1438
01:05:21,080 --> 01:05:21,600
Oh, level 10.

1439
01:05:21,720 --> 01:05:22,140
Hmm, nice.

1440
01:05:23,480 --> 01:05:25,240
I think I'll use my diamond axe for killing.

1441
01:05:32,840 --> 01:05:34,300
Leather armor looks really cool.

1442
01:05:41,220 --> 01:05:41,860
Oh, God.

1443
01:05:42,360 --> 01:05:43,020
Not you.

1444
01:05:47,530 --> 01:05:49,950
Why can't you be more like that other kid I saw in the village?

1445
01:05:50,210 --> 01:05:51,470
He was not aggressive or anything.

1446
01:05:52,090 --> 01:05:54,570
In fact, he was very nice, and he had a cool head on.

1447
01:05:55,270 --> 01:05:56,290
Why can't you be like that?

1448
01:05:56,370 --> 01:05:56,530
Kid!

1449
01:06:01,130 --> 01:06:01,710
You know what?

1450
01:06:01,710 --> 01:06:02,170
I should go to bed.

1451
01:06:05,500 --> 01:06:06,780
That house is still burning.

1452
01:06:10,120 --> 01:06:12,980
One would think I may care, but I don't.

1453
01:06:14,780 --> 01:06:15,660
Let me sleep.

1454
01:06:19,810 --> 01:06:20,330
Okay.

1455
01:06:22,070 --> 01:06:23,050
Let's keep going, huh?

1456
01:06:24,410 --> 01:06:25,910
Actually, I wanted to find a quick chest.

1457
01:06:29,390 --> 01:06:30,370
If you have one.

1458
01:06:32,250 --> 01:06:33,630
What the fuck was that?

1459
01:06:38,700 --> 01:06:39,860
Is that a creeper?

1460
01:06:40,020 --> 01:06:41,320
That sounded so big.

1461
01:06:42,380 --> 01:06:43,420
Massive firework.

1462
01:06:47,000 --> 01:06:47,960
You don't have a chest.

1463
01:06:48,180 --> 01:06:48,460
Whatever.

1464
01:06:48,860 --> 01:06:49,720
I'm moving on.

1465
01:06:54,470 --> 01:06:54,930
Okay.

1466
01:06:54,970 --> 01:06:55,270
You know what?

1467
01:06:55,350 --> 01:06:58,250
Since we're in the snow, we should keep an eye out.

1468
01:06:59,210 --> 01:07:01,010
Look for a igloo.

1469
01:07:12,280 --> 01:07:12,940
Another butt.

1470
01:07:14,500 --> 01:07:16,180
It's the butt of the ice bear.

1471
01:07:18,200 --> 01:07:18,840
No?

1472
01:07:23,960 --> 01:07:24,600
No?

1473
01:07:24,720 --> 01:07:25,340
Not seeing it.

1474
01:07:28,700 --> 01:07:29,260
Hup!

1475
01:07:29,740 --> 01:07:30,240
Oh, wait.

1476
01:07:30,420 --> 01:07:30,940
This is...

1477
01:07:30,940 --> 01:07:31,640
Ah, this is ice.

1478
01:07:32,420 --> 01:07:32,920
Yeah.

1479
01:07:33,240 --> 01:07:33,920
It's ice.

1480
01:07:34,620 --> 01:07:35,880
Of course it's ice.

1481
01:07:36,480 --> 01:07:37,860
We're in the winter.

1482
01:07:39,700 --> 01:07:40,280
Whoa.

1483
01:07:40,860 --> 01:07:41,380
Massive speed.

1484
01:07:41,520 --> 01:07:43,280
I don't think I've been this far east before.

1485
01:07:44,100 --> 01:07:45,640
And it's not even that far.

1486
01:07:51,300 --> 01:07:51,880
It's alright.

1487
01:07:53,200 --> 01:07:53,820
Everything's fine.

1488
01:08:01,220 --> 01:08:03,340
I wonder if I took this with me.

1489
01:08:03,500 --> 01:08:05,000
So I have silk touch, right?

1490
01:08:06,280 --> 01:08:06,720
Ooh!

1491
01:08:09,980 --> 01:08:10,600
Wait, what?

1492
01:08:11,140 --> 01:08:12,140
What did I just unlock?

1493
01:08:13,840 --> 01:08:14,520
Wait a minute.

1494
01:08:14,700 --> 01:08:15,740
I gotta see this real fast.

1495
01:08:25,740 --> 01:08:26,460
Packed ice.

1496
01:08:29,520 --> 01:08:31,160
What the fuck is the difference?

1497
01:08:37,400 --> 01:08:38,600
Wait a minute now.

1498
01:08:48,610 --> 01:08:49,990
Just going the other way or what?

1499
01:08:53,530 --> 01:08:54,430
Blue ice.

1500
01:08:54,830 --> 01:08:55,290
What?

1501
01:08:57,330 --> 01:08:59,390
Okay, so that requires a lot of packed ice.

1502
01:08:59,770 --> 01:09:00,030
Haha!

1503
01:09:02,210 --> 01:09:04,110
Oh my god, this is actually really, uh...

1504
01:09:04,110 --> 01:09:04,470
Brrrring.

1505
01:09:05,710 --> 01:09:06,190
Unexpectedly.

1506
01:09:10,600 --> 01:09:11,780
Let me take a look at that.

1507
01:09:15,080 --> 01:09:15,960
Packed ice.

1508
01:09:17,300 --> 01:09:18,300
Oh, I don't have enough.

1509
01:09:24,170 --> 01:09:25,370
Gotta see what this leads to.

1510
01:09:30,680 --> 01:09:31,660
Oh my god, come on.

1511
01:09:32,700 --> 01:09:33,340
One more.

1512
01:09:39,540 --> 01:09:40,480
Blue ice.

1513
01:09:47,920 --> 01:09:48,280
Okay.

1514
01:09:51,620 --> 01:09:52,220
That's weird.

1515
01:09:53,400 --> 01:09:54,260
But, uh, you know what?

1516
01:09:54,260 --> 01:09:54,980
I'll take it with me.

1517
01:09:56,780 --> 01:10:00,620
If I get to the Saharan Desert, I will, uh, have to put that in my drink.

1518
01:10:03,420 --> 01:10:04,160
Seems good enough.

1519
01:10:06,280 --> 01:10:06,640
Okay.

1520
01:10:07,200 --> 01:10:07,940
We move on.

1521
01:10:08,660 --> 01:10:10,220
That was, uh, mildly interesting.

1522
01:10:11,780 --> 01:10:13,320
I'm just glad I discovered new recipes.

1523
01:10:13,620 --> 01:10:14,460
The more I get, the better.

1524
01:10:17,180 --> 01:10:18,480
Keep an eye out for Igloo.

1525
01:10:23,270 --> 01:10:24,590
What is this down here, huh?

1526
01:10:33,340 --> 01:10:34,220
Look kind of neat.

1527
01:10:38,660 --> 01:10:41,440
Wouldn't it be cool to have, like, houses on the sides of these walls?

1528
01:10:42,400 --> 01:10:44,200
Similar to, uh, the time machine.

1529
01:10:45,200 --> 01:10:46,680
With, um, what's his name?

1530
01:10:46,720 --> 01:10:47,280
Guy Pearce.

1531
01:10:55,640 --> 01:10:56,120
Oh.

1532
01:10:57,340 --> 01:10:57,980
Is that?

1533
01:10:59,180 --> 01:10:59,820
Is that?

1534
01:11:00,240 --> 01:11:01,100
Is that an Igloo?

1535
01:11:02,280 --> 01:11:03,360
Are we Igloo-ing?

1536
01:11:06,260 --> 01:11:07,160
Looks like an Igloo.

1537
01:11:07,640 --> 01:11:08,220
What's that?

1538
01:11:10,060 --> 01:11:10,920
It's a ship.

1539
01:11:24,880 --> 01:11:25,300
Dude.

1540
01:11:27,840 --> 01:11:28,520
Look at that.

1541
01:11:28,900 --> 01:11:29,280
Oh.

1542
01:11:29,560 --> 01:11:30,340
We do need this.

1543
01:11:33,440 --> 01:11:35,620
I always underestimate how fast you are on ice.

1544
01:11:41,020 --> 01:11:42,480
We got a tower over here, too.

1545
01:11:47,240 --> 01:11:49,040
Slow down, slow down, slow down, slow down.

1546
01:11:50,960 --> 01:11:52,020
Stop, stop, stop, stop.

1547
01:11:53,440 --> 01:11:53,860
Huh?

1548
01:11:55,800 --> 01:11:56,920
Oh, look at that!

1549
01:11:57,900 --> 01:12:02,020
They made, uh, what do they call- No, the ones they put in the field to scare off the birds.

1550
01:12:03,900 --> 01:12:04,720
There's a name for that.

1551
01:12:08,660 --> 01:12:09,480
That's not an Igloo.

1552
01:12:09,640 --> 01:12:10,160
I don't think.

1553
01:12:11,860 --> 01:12:12,720
I'm gonna head over here.

1554
01:12:13,280 --> 01:12:15,280
Does this kind of look like a Lego house from a distance?

1555
01:12:15,400 --> 01:12:15,740
Look at this.

1556
01:12:16,680 --> 01:12:17,420
Looks like Lego.

1557
01:12:20,080 --> 01:12:20,400
Emeralds?

1558
01:12:20,860 --> 01:12:21,180
No.

1559
01:12:21,940 --> 01:12:22,860
They f- Whooped!

1560
01:12:23,740 --> 01:12:24,200
Fooled me.

1561
01:12:27,170 --> 01:12:27,630
Oh, God.

1562
01:12:32,120 --> 01:12:32,600
Okay.

1563
01:12:33,060 --> 01:12:33,740
Come on now.

1564
01:12:33,860 --> 01:12:34,260
I can't die.

1565
01:12:34,480 --> 01:12:35,360
I have netherite!

1566
01:12:37,220 --> 01:12:38,120
Get out of my boat!

1567
01:12:40,500 --> 01:12:40,980
Asshole.

1568
01:12:41,660 --> 01:12:42,120
There

1569
01:12:51,560 --> 01:12:51,660
you are.

1570
01:12:52,200 --> 01:12:52,420
Okay.

1571
01:12:54,940 --> 01:12:55,780
No problem.

1572
01:12:57,900 --> 01:12:59,060
Just a bit of a problem.

1573
01:13:04,420 --> 01:13:05,380
Let me see this.

1574
01:13:07,620 --> 01:13:08,660
Man, what is the name for that?

1575
01:13:11,080 --> 01:13:12,020
Oh, it's these guys.

1576
01:13:12,920 --> 01:13:13,960
It's like, what is that sound?

1577
01:13:20,030 --> 01:13:20,350
Missed!

1578
01:13:22,150 --> 01:13:22,770
Oh, my God.

1579
01:13:22,870 --> 01:13:23,070
Beautiful.

1580
01:13:23,630 --> 01:13:24,690
I'm a combat master.

1581
01:13:27,630 --> 01:13:28,050
Look at them.

1582
01:13:28,110 --> 01:13:29,290
They even have a little hat of snow.

1583
01:13:33,680 --> 01:13:34,000
Neat.

1584
01:13:34,240 --> 01:13:34,800
Carp pumpkin.

1585
01:13:35,980 --> 01:13:36,660
You know what?

1586
01:13:36,920 --> 01:13:38,300
I kind of want to make this at home.

1587
01:13:39,120 --> 01:13:39,520
Imagine.

1588
01:13:39,760 --> 01:13:42,480
So, my plan is to have these big fields, right?

1589
01:13:43,460 --> 01:13:46,160
All these fields with wheat and rice and everything.

1590
01:13:46,160 --> 01:13:48,020
It's going to be like as far as the eye can see.

1591
01:13:48,140 --> 01:13:50,360
And then, occasionally, I'll have this in between.

1592
01:13:51,540 --> 01:13:52,060
You know?

1593
01:13:54,000 --> 01:13:55,080
Also, let me put this back.

1594
01:13:55,500 --> 01:13:56,360
Let's not be mean.

1595
01:13:57,080 --> 01:13:58,600
They are my sworn enemies.

1596
01:13:58,820 --> 01:13:59,660
But, you know, still.

1597
01:14:03,300 --> 01:14:04,920
You can't just go around and do that.

1598
01:14:07,800 --> 01:14:08,680
Now, where's the rest?

1599
01:14:08,920 --> 01:14:09,720
I feel like killing.

1600
01:14:13,760 --> 01:14:14,640
Botolo enchanting!

1601
01:14:16,340 --> 01:14:17,700
That's the one that gives experience.

1602
01:14:17,920 --> 01:14:18,280
But!

1603
01:14:19,260 --> 01:14:20,440
Maybe it does more.

1604
01:14:21,860 --> 01:14:22,780
Let's, uh...

1605
01:14:22,780 --> 01:14:23,420
Curse of Binding.

1606
01:14:23,880 --> 01:14:25,300
Let's just try and keep that in mind.

1607
01:14:25,460 --> 01:14:26,460
I don't think I want this.

1608
01:14:26,720 --> 01:14:27,640
Why would I want this?

1609
01:14:29,680 --> 01:14:30,340
That's terrible.

1610
01:14:30,720 --> 01:14:31,360
Nobody wants that.

1611
01:14:34,860 --> 01:14:35,300
Sure.

1612
01:14:35,520 --> 01:14:35,680
Nope.

1613
01:14:35,820 --> 01:14:36,420
Food in here.

1614
01:14:36,420 --> 01:14:37,760
That's the food box.

1615
01:14:38,800 --> 01:14:40,160
The rest I don't really want.

1616
01:14:41,460 --> 01:14:42,980
We have a good vantage point here, though.

1617
01:14:44,420 --> 01:14:46,000
We can scope out our next target.

1618
01:14:49,360 --> 01:14:50,000
Look at him.

1619
01:14:50,220 --> 01:14:51,820
Is he trapped on a piece of ice?

1620
01:14:57,900 --> 01:14:59,360
Lots of sugar cane over there.

1621
01:15:00,800 --> 01:15:01,760
Oh, a portal.

1622
01:15:04,020 --> 01:15:06,300
Es sollte einen portal sein.

1623
01:15:07,800 --> 01:15:08,260
Wait.

1624
01:15:09,600 --> 01:15:10,040
Iglo?

1625
01:15:10,540 --> 01:15:11,380
Is that an Iglo?

1626
01:15:12,740 --> 01:15:13,760
Looks like an Igloo!

1627
01:15:15,660 --> 01:15:18,020
I definitely want to explore that ship and go find a treasure.

1628
01:15:19,300 --> 01:15:19,820
Igloo?

1629
01:15:20,100 --> 01:15:20,600
No.

1630
01:15:21,460 --> 01:15:21,800
Hmm.

1631
01:15:25,040 --> 01:15:25,560
Igloo!

1632
01:15:25,760 --> 01:15:26,080
No.

1633
01:15:26,400 --> 01:15:26,720
Wait.

1634
01:15:27,520 --> 01:15:29,400
I don't remember what an Igloo looks like.

1635
01:15:31,280 --> 01:15:31,800
No.

1636
01:15:33,700 --> 01:15:34,220
Shit.

1637
01:15:35,160 --> 01:15:35,780
All right.

1638
01:15:35,900 --> 01:15:36,820
Well, um...

1639
01:15:37,520 --> 01:15:38,500
Oh, hey there.

1640
01:15:38,920 --> 01:15:39,660
Watch this.

1641
01:15:40,800 --> 01:15:41,420
Jump attack.

1642
01:15:41,840 --> 01:15:42,100
Yeah!

1643
01:15:45,740 --> 01:15:46,340
Dude.

1644
01:15:47,160 --> 01:15:47,940
Wait a minute.

1645
01:15:48,240 --> 01:15:49,880
Did the snow break my fall?

1646
01:15:50,500 --> 01:15:51,520
Wait a minute.

1647
01:15:53,120 --> 01:15:54,400
Oh my god, there's many.

1648
01:15:54,820 --> 01:15:55,640
There's a lot.

1649
01:15:57,040 --> 01:15:58,040
There's a lot.

1650
01:15:58,860 --> 01:15:59,420
Har.

1651
01:15:59,760 --> 01:16:00,180
Har.

1652
01:16:01,540 --> 01:16:02,100
Har.

1653
01:16:03,760 --> 01:16:05,060
Can I join your clan?

1654
01:16:05,860 --> 01:16:07,780
I can say har as well.

1655
01:16:09,260 --> 01:16:10,980
We can go raiding together.

1656
01:16:11,360 --> 01:16:12,540
If you want to.

1657
01:16:12,780 --> 01:16:12,820
Dad.

1658
01:16:14,280 --> 01:16:15,580
Why there's so many of you?

1659
01:16:15,720 --> 01:16:16,120
I need to eat.

1660
01:16:18,420 --> 01:16:18,980
Boink.

1661
01:16:19,800 --> 01:16:20,240
Doink.

1662
01:16:20,820 --> 01:16:21,260
Doink.

1663
01:16:21,260 --> 01:16:21,740
Come on.

1664
01:16:22,200 --> 01:16:22,880
Door technique!

1665
01:16:23,260 --> 01:16:24,080
Even though there's no door.

1666
01:16:25,660 --> 01:16:26,600
How are you hitting me?

1667
01:16:27,380 --> 01:16:30,020
Do you possess a piercing stat?

1668
01:16:32,180 --> 01:16:32,820
There's more!

1669
01:16:36,290 --> 01:16:36,830
Hold on.

1670
01:16:36,890 --> 01:16:38,110
I need to see that thing again.

1671
01:16:38,330 --> 01:16:39,490
Did the snow break my fall?

1672
01:16:40,030 --> 01:16:41,650
I feel like I took no damage from that.

1673
01:16:48,830 --> 01:16:49,230
No.

1674
01:16:49,710 --> 01:16:50,430
It didn't.

1675
01:16:51,250 --> 01:16:52,190
I imagined it.

1676
01:17:00,270 --> 01:17:01,710
I think these guys are going to keep spawning.

1677
01:17:08,940 --> 01:17:09,840
Maybe it's time to leave.

1678
01:17:14,510 --> 01:17:15,350
Yeah, you know what?

1679
01:17:15,530 --> 01:17:16,130
Get the hell out of here.

1680
01:17:16,910 --> 01:17:17,830
Let's put on the bed.

1681
01:17:20,270 --> 01:17:21,250
And go into a sleep.

1682
01:17:30,430 --> 01:17:31,490
Now, where did I want to go?

1683
01:17:32,490 --> 01:17:33,930
I think I want to go to...

1684
01:17:33,930 --> 01:17:35,090
I think I saw a thing over here.

1685
01:17:36,330 --> 01:17:37,190
That looked interesting.

1686
01:17:42,340 --> 01:17:42,780
You're free.

1687
01:17:45,000 --> 01:17:45,460
Oh, yeah.

1688
01:17:47,440 --> 01:17:47,920
There you go.

1689
01:17:49,120 --> 01:17:50,900
I'm going to go get the sugar cane.

1690
01:17:51,020 --> 01:17:52,120
And you need to die.

1691
01:17:56,620 --> 01:17:57,040
Boat.

1692
01:17:58,020 --> 01:17:58,800
And on we go.

1693
01:17:59,780 --> 01:18:00,180
Oh!

1694
01:18:00,360 --> 01:18:00,720
Shipwreck!

1695
01:18:00,840 --> 01:18:01,380
That's what I wanted.

1696
01:18:02,360 --> 01:18:02,780
Shipwreck.

1697
01:18:03,640 --> 01:18:04,920
Sugar cane, then shipwreck.

1698
01:18:05,360 --> 01:18:05,780
Oh!

1699
01:18:07,820 --> 01:18:08,240
Phew!

1700
01:18:13,490 --> 01:18:14,310
Faster, faster.

1701
01:18:20,570 --> 01:18:21,230
There it is.

1702
01:18:22,690 --> 01:18:24,630
I'm going to go break some sugar cane with a bed.

1703
01:18:25,010 --> 01:18:31,310
There's no other game where you can say that sentence and be reasonable in your sentencing.

1704
01:18:32,550 --> 01:18:33,650
Wait, you can't say that.

1705
01:18:33,770 --> 01:18:34,950
Sentencing is for criminals.

1706
01:18:38,280 --> 01:18:38,680
Yeah.

1707
01:18:39,180 --> 01:18:40,640
That work doesn't work in this case.

1708
01:18:41,740 --> 01:18:42,720
Can't be like...

1709
01:18:42,720 --> 01:18:44,220
All right, there was nice sentencing with you.

1710
01:18:46,060 --> 01:18:46,580
I don't know.

1711
01:18:46,640 --> 01:18:48,860
Maybe judges talk like that to each other.

1712
01:18:48,860 --> 01:18:50,680
So, did you have good sentencing today?

